OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers welcome council pledge to
OL,4,Ahold on to land
OL,5,
OL,6,FTenant farmers have welcomed a decision
OL,7,Fby Lincolnshire County Council not to
OL,8,Fsell off farmland.
OL,10,FThe authority launched a review of the
OL,11,F152 farms it owns after a new Reform UK
OL,12,Fadministration took control in May
OL,13,F2025.
OL,15,FNow, the council has approved a 10-year
OL,16,Fstrategy for managing the farms, which
OL,17,Fkeeps the door open for "strategic
OL,18,Fdisposals" of some parcels of land in
OL,19,Ffuture.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
