OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers welcome council pledge to
OL,4,Ahold on to land
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Gash, a tenant farmer in Blankney,
OL,7,Fnear Woodhall Spa, said it was
OL,8,F"reassuring news".
